# Browser Testing Server

All browser testing via @Browser MUST use the dev server on port 5174, which has a manually authenticated session.

- Navigate to `http://localhost:5174` (never another port)
- If the server is not running, start it on port 5174 without asking
- If the server needs restarting, restart it on port 5174 without asking
